  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「Furnace Recycle」為所有含金屬的原版物品新增熔煉配方。熔煉回取得的資源雖不及原物品消耗之多，但這些微量的鐵和金累積起來仍十分可觀。你可以熔煉礦坑中的軌道，或是竊取村莊的鐘。你大概甚至不需要再去挖礦了！由於每件物品回產量較少，因此不會產生物品複製的風險。<br><br>完整的熔煉配方列表如下。熔煉每件物品需要 200 刻（ticks），並給予 0.1 點經驗值。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵砧：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐘：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鍊鍋：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>（靈魂）燈籠：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>切石機：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/furnace-recycle/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"526\" height=\"306\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>完整熔煉配方列表：</strong></span><br><em>激活鐵軌 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>鐵砧 -&gt; 鐵塊</em><br><em>鐘 -&gt; 金錠</em><br><em>高爐 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>桶 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>鍊鍋 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>鎖鏈 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>弩 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>探測鐵軌 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>打火石與鋼 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>重型壓力板 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>漏斗 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>鐵欄杆 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>鐵門 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>（靈魂）燈籠 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>輕型壓力板 -&gt; 金錠</em><br><em>礦車 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>黏性活塞 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>動力鐵軌 -&gt; 金粒</em><br><em>鐵軌 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>剪刀 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>盾牌 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>鍛造台 -&gt; 鐵錠</em><br><em>切石機 -&gt; 鐵粒</em><br><em>偵測線鉤 -&gt; 鐵粒</em></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中，即可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立模組頁面中追蹤留言，已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
